{"text": "a baby boy was coming!", "start": 148.84, "end": 150.68, "words": [{"text": "a", "start": 148.84, "end": 149.36}, {"text": "baby", "start": 149.36, "end": 149.72}, {"text": "boy", "start": 149.72, "end": 150.16}, {"text": "was", "start": 150.16, "end": 150.4}, {"text": "coming!", "start": 150.4, "end": 150.68}]},
{"text": "Ema opened her eyes.", "start": 152.28, "end": 153.64, "words": [{"text": "Ema", "start": 152.28, "end": 152.58}, {"text": "opened", "start": 152.58, "end": 153.02}, {"text": "her", "start": 153.02, "end": 153.24}, {"text": "eyes.", "start": 153.24, "end": 153.64}]},
{"text": "\"Papa, did God hear them all along?\"", "start": 154.3, "end": 156.86, "words": [{"text": "\"Papa,", "start": 154.3, "end": 154.6}, {"text": "did", "start": 155.18, "end": 155.34}, {"text": "God", "start": 155.34, "end": 155.66}, {"text": "hear", "start": 155.66, "end": 155.98}, {"text": "them", "start": 155.98, "end": 156.16}, {"text": "all", "start": 156.16, "end": 156.48}, {"text": "along?\"", "start": 156.48, "end": 156.86}]},
{"text": "\"All along,\" said Papa.", "start": 157.66, "end": 159.38, "words": [{"text": "\"All", "start": 157.66, "end": 157.98}, {"text": "along,\"", "start": 157.98, "end": 158.38}, {"text": "said", "start": 158.82, "end": 159.06}, {"text": "Papa.", "start": 159.06, "end": 159.38}]},
{"text": "\"Every prayer.", "start": 160.0, "end": 160.84, "words": [{"text": "\"Every", "start": 160.0, "end": 160.4}, {"text": "prayer.", "start": 160.4, "end": 160.84}]},
{"text": "Sometimes we wait a long time, but God is always listening.", "start": 161.46, "end": 165.22, "words": [{"text": "Sometimes", "start": 161.46, "end": 161.76}, {"text": "we", "start": 161.76, "end": 162.12}, {"text": "wait", "start": 162.12, "end": 162.34}, {"text": "a", "start": 162.34, "end": 162.48}, {"text": "long", "start": 162.48, "end": 162.74}, {"text": "time,", "start": 162.74, "end": 163.14}, {"text": "but", "start": 163.5, "end": 163.68}, {"text": "God", "start": 163.68, "end": 163.98}, {"text": "is", "start": 163.98, "end": 164.2}, {"text": "always", "start": 164.2, "end": 164.72}, {"text": "listening.", "start": 164.72, "end": 165.22}]},
{"text": "And baby John would grow up to get everyone ready for Jesus.\"", "start": 165.7, "end": 168.66, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 165.7, "end": 165.78}, {"text": "baby", "start": 165.78, "end": 166.0}, {"text": "John", "start": 166.0, "end": 166.32}, {"text": "would", "start": 166.32, "end": 166.52}, {"text": "grow", "start": 166.52, "end": 166.76}, {"text": "up", "start": 166.76, "end": 166.96}, {"text": "to", "start": 166.96, "end": 167.1}, {"text": "get", "start": 167.1, "end": 167.24}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 167.24, "end": 167.76}, {"text": "ready", "start": 167.76, "end": 168.14}, {"text": "for", "start": 168.14, "end": 168.34}, {"text": "Jesus.\"", "start": 168.34, "end": 168.66}]},
{"text": "\"Christmas is coming!\"", "start": 169.42, "end": 170.42, "words": [{"text": "\"Christmas", "start": 169.42, "end": 169.8}, {"text": "is", "start": 169.8, "end": 170.1}, {"text": "coming!\"", "start": 170.1, "end": 170.42}]},
{"text": "said Mummy.", "start": 170.76, "end": 171.22, "words": [{"text": "said", "start": 170.76, "end": 171.0}, {"text": "Mummy.", "start": 171.0, "end": 171.22}]},
{"text": "\"Tomorrow, let's draw a prayer and put it in our prayer jar.\"", "start": 171.72, "end": 174.68, "words": [{"text": "\"Tomorrow,", "start": 171.72, "end": 172.0}, {"text": "let's", "start": 172.36, "end": 172.72}, {"text": "draw", "start": 172.72, "end": 172.92}, {"text": "a", "start": 172.92, "end": 173.06}, {"text": "prayer", "start": 173.06, "end": 173.3}, {"text": "and", "start": 173.3, "end": 173.56}, {"text": "put", "start": 173.56, "end": 173.78}, {"text": "it", "start": 173.78, "end": 173.88}, {"text": "in", "start": 173.88, "end": 174.02}, {"text": "our", "start": 174.02, "end": 174.12}, {"text": "prayer", "start": 174.12, "end": 174.4}, {"text": "jar.\"", "start": 174.4, "end": 174.68}]},
{"text": "\"And I'll water my bean!\"", "start": 175.16, "end": 176.48, "words": [{"text": "\"And", "start": 175.16, "end": 175.38}, {"text": "I'll", "start": 175.38, "end": 175.6}, {"text": "water", "start": 175.6, "end": 175.88}, {"text": "my", "start": 175.88, "end": 176.12}, {"text": "bean!\"", "start": 176.12, "end": 176.48}]},
{"text": "said Ema.", "start": 176.74, "end": 177.3, "words": [{"text": "said", "start": 176.74, "end": 177.02}, {"text": "Ema.", "start": 177.02, "end": 177.3}]},
{"text": "What about you, little one?", "start": 177.8, "end": 178.82, "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 177.8, "end": 177.96}, {"text": "about", "start": 177.96, "end": 178.12}, {"text": "you,", "start": 178.12, "end": 178.36}, {"text": "little", "start": 178.4, "end": 178.58}, {"text": "one?", "start": 178.58, "end": 178.82}]},
{"text": "What would you like to tell God tonight?", "start": 179.18, "end": 180.74, "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 179.18, "end": 179.34}, {"text": "would", "start": 179.34, "end": 179.48}, {"text": "you", "start": 179.48, "end": 179.66}, {"text": "like", "start": 179.66, "end": 179.86}, {"text": "to", "start": 179.86, "end": 180.0}, {"text": "tell", "start": 180.0, "end": 180.18}, {"text": "God", "start": 180.18, "end": 180.4}, {"text": "tonight?", "start": 180.4, "end": 180.74}]},
{"text": "God hears you.", "start": 184.22, "end": 185.54, "words": [{"text": "God", "start": 184.22, "end": 184.88}, {"text": "hears", "start": 184.88, "end": 185.22}, {"text": "you.", "start": 185.22, "end": 185.54}]},
{"text": "You know, little one…", "start": 187.84, "end": 189.08, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 187.84, "end": 188.16}, {"text": "know,", "start": 188.16, "end": 188.38}, {"text": "little", "start": 188.66, "end": 188.78}, {"text": "one…", "start": 188.78, "end": 189.08}]},
{"text": "God hears every prayer, big or small, even whispered ones.", "start": 189.84, "end": 194.54, "words": [{"text": "God", "start": 189.84, "end": 190.12}, {"text": "hears", "start": 190.12, "end": 190.48}, {"text": "every", "start": 190.48, "end": 191.08}, {"text": "prayer,", "start": 191.08, "end": 191.48}, {"text": "big", "start": 191.98, "end": 192.16}, {"text": "or", "start": 192.16, "end": 192.5}, {"text": "small,", "start": 192.5, "end": 192.92}, {"text": "even", "start": 193.5, "end": 193.74}, {"text": "whispered", "start": 193.74, "end": 194.36}, {"text": "ones.", "start": 194.36, "end": 194.54}]},
{"text": "Like Ema's bean, hiding under the soil, God is doing good things even when we can't see them yet.", "start": 195.5, "end": 201.58, "words": [{"text": "Like", "start": 195.5, "end": 195.72}, {"text": "Ema's", "start": 195.72, "end": 196.16}, {"text": "bean,", "start": 196.16, "end": 196.42}, {"text": "hiding", "start": 196.42, "end": 197.02}, {"text": "under", "start": 197.02, "end": 197.34}, {"text": "the", "start": 197.34, "end": 197.5}, {"text": "soil,", "start": 197.5, "end": 197.82}, {"text": "God", "start": 198.5, "end": 198.72}, {"text": "is", "start": 198.72, "end": 198.9}, {"text": "doing", "start": 198.9, "end": 199.12}, {"text": "good", "start": 199.12, "end": 199.46}, {"text": "things", "start": 199.46, "end": 199.96}, {"text": "even", "start": 199.96, "end": 200.3}, {"text": "when", "start": 200.3, "end": 200.5}, {"text": "we", "start": 200.5, "end": 200.66}, {"text": "can't", "start": 200.66, "end": 201.0}, {"text": "see", "start": 201.0, "end": 201.14}, {"text": "them", "start": 201.14, "end": 201.32}, {"text": "yet.", "start": 201.32, "end": 201.58}]},
{"text": "Ema peeked at her little pot on the windowsill.", "start": 202.36, "end": 204.78, "words": [{"text": "Ema", "start": 202.36, "end": 202.68}, {"text": "peeked", "start": 202.68, "end": 203.16}, {"text": "at", "start": 203.16, "end": 203.26}, {"text": "her", "start": 203.26, "end": 203.42}, {"text": "little", "start": 203.42, "end": 203.64}, {"text": "pot", "start": 203.64, "end": 203.94}, {"text": "on", "start": 203.94, "end": 204.14}, {"text": "the", "start": 204.14, "end": 204.26}, {"text": "windowsill.", "start": 204.26, "end": 204.78}]},
{"text": "Then they all held hands.", "start": 205.34, "end": 207.0, "words": [{"text": "Then", "start": 205.34, "end": 205.62}, {"text": "they", "start": 205.62, "end": 205.94}, {"text": "all", "start": 205.94, "end": 206.32}, {"text": "held", "start": 206.32, "end": 206.56}, {"text": "hands.", "start": 206.56, "end": 207.0}]},
{"text": "Let's pray.", "start": 207.92, "end": 208.76, "words": [{"text": "Let's", "start": 207.92, "end": 208.46}, {"text": "pray.", "start": 208.46, "end": 208.76}]},
{"text": "Dear Jesus…", "start": 209.7, "end": 210.34, "words": [{"text": "Dear", "start": 209.7, "end": 209.9}, {"text": "Jesus…", "start": 209.9, "end": 210.34}]},
{"text": "thank You that You always hear me.", "start": 211.0, "end": 212.98, "words": [{"text": "thank", "start": 211.0, "end": 211.36}, {"text": "You", "start": 211.36, "end": 211.6}, {"text": "that", "start": 211.6, "end": 211.82}, {"text": "You", "start": 211.82, "end": 211.98}, {"text": "always", "start": 211.98, "end": 212.44}, {"text": "hear", "start": 212.44, "end": 212.76}, {"text": "me.", "start": 212.76, "end": 212.98}]},
{"text": "Help me wait and trust You.", "start": 213.72, "end": 215.38, "words": [{"text": "Help", "start": 213.72, "end": 213.88}, {"text": "me", "start": 213.88, "end": 214.08}, {"text": "wait", "start": 214.08, "end": 214.4}, {"text": "and", "start": 214.4, "end": 214.74}, {"text": "trust", "start": 214.74, "end": 215.04}, {"text": "You.", "start": 215.04, "end": 215.38}]},
{"text": "Amen.", "start": 215.94, "end": 216.2, "words": [{"text": "Amen.", "start": 215.94, "end": 216.2}]},
{"text": "Goodnight, little light.", "start": 217.2, "end": 218.68, "words": [{"text": "Goodnight,", "start": 217.2, "end": 218.04}, {"text": "little", "start": 218.24, "end": 218.3}, {"text": "light.", "start": 218.3, "end": 218.68}]},
{"text": "Sleep tight.", "start": 219.32, "end": 219.78, "words": [{"text": "Sleep", "start": 219.32, "end": 219.42}, {"text": "tight.", "start": 219.42, "end": 219.78}]},
{"text": "Eighteen more nights to go.", "start": 220.44, "end": 221.9, "words": [{"text": "Eighteen", "start": 220.44, "end": 220.96}, {"text": "more", "start": 220.96, "end": 221.16}, {"text": "nights", "start": 221.16, "end": 221.44}, {"text": "to", "start": 221.44, "end": 221.66}, {"text": "go.", "start": 221.66, "end": 221.9}]}
]
